# Pyrokinesis: "4 damage divided as you choose among any number of target creatures" (CR 601.2d): three Ornithopters (0/2) of
# Bot2 as targets with shares 2, 1 and 1 that add up to 4 - the first dies, the other two survive with 1 damage each. The
# Lightning Bolt in hand is the red card exiled for the alternative cost.

